{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">環西班牙單車賽，法國車手杜桑勝出第10站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">經過一日休息後，環西班牙賽再次展開，今站全長184.7公里，地形起伏不斷，有三個三級坡。早段多數車手留守主車群，留待尾段發力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263I0biQdfBf1788308454.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在總成績領先的馬斯，安全跟隨大集團返終點。有車手嘗試突圍，但未能甩開其他對手。主車群追上後，最後階段變成混戰。抽出右方，藍衫、白色頭盔的杜桑在終點衝刺中脫穎而出，成為今站冠軍。這位24歲法國車手，首次奪得環西班牙賽分站冠軍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gdU1jLJCcT1788308460.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西班牙的馬斯，繼續穿上象徵總成績領先的紅衫。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026E60D1YORpr1788308456.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T00:44:11.074275+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}